Calculated files are placed into CALCULATIONS_DIR */home/willow/prj/amax/amax-calculations).

1. Calculate ephemeris
	perl geoCoord.pl 1980 common

This calculates ephdata1980.dat.

Saving cached ephemeris...Done. Restart with the same parameters to calculate common.dat

2. Calculate common datafile
	perl geoCoord.pl 1980 common
	perl gen_amax.pl join 2018

3. Calculate location data
	perl geoCoord.pl 2018 all

Build Astromaximum for Android
1. cd amax-droid-hg/Backend
2. perl calculate_demo.pl 2018 0 12 data/loclist_vasia.txt
3. Run Eclipse from ~/program/eclipse
4. File->Export->Export Android Application, select ~/program/keystore/amax.keystore.jks, use strong password

Build Astromaximum for j2me
1. ./gen_amax.pl notest 2018 ru loclist_vasia.txt -
